+         Failed example:
+             1/0
+         Exception raised:
+             Traceback (most recent call last):
+               File "<doctest test.test_doctest.sample_doctest_errors.errors[1]>", line 1, in <module>
+                 1/0
+                 ~^~
+             ZeroDivisionError: division by zero
+         ----------------------------------------------------------------------
